+</head>
+<body class="nd">
+<div id="nd-header"></div>
+<main class="bk-wrap">
+<p class="bk-eyebrow">Brokers</p>
+<h1 class="bk-title">Stockwise Holdings</h1>
+<p class="bk-sub">Every broker that traded a stock, netted over the period — net bought means accumulating, net sold means distributing. This is transaction flow, not verified shareholding.</p>
