+    <ol class="sc-steps">
+      <li><span class="sc-step-n">1</span><h3>Start with the market verdict</h3><p>The score above blends four real factors — signal breadth, score momentum, RSI posture and participation. Trade with the wind: in a Risk-off tape, even Strong Buys deserve smaller size.</p></li>
